1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:06,890
Serengeti. Full throttle into the heart of the Great Zebra Migration.

2
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,687
Look all around you—hundreds of thousands of hooves, moving as one.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,040
Ten camera rigs. Eighty kilometers an hour through golden dust.

4
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,079
Hold on—straight through the Mara River crossing!

5
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,551
Stripes blur predator vision in motion, guiding the herd across a continent.

6
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,180
No fences. No roads. Just the greatest overland race on Earth.

7
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,901
Look to the horizon. Where shall our next expedition take you?
